type: software
title: "Code and results for: Tree-based Local Learners in Federated Learning with Local Undersampling: A Multi-Algorithm Empirical Study across Nine Tabular Benchmarks"
abstract: "Code, raw results and analysis scripts of a full factorial experiment (86 400 analysed federated runs) on undersampling applied independently on each client of one-shot federated ensembles of tree-based learners, on nine public tabular data sets."
